Corrected message:

Stop Cancel in the palette-reset prompt from wiping the palette

The prompt shown when Resize Palette changes the row count of an
edited palette had its answer inverted: Cancel/Keep replaced the
colours with the defaults, and Reset Palette kept them. The answer is
no longer negated, and Reset Palette now gets destructive styling so
Cancel/Keep is the Enter-key default, like the other confirmation
prompts added in bf7072f9.
